#
# Provides the ColorConverter class containing static pure functions for
# converting colors between RGB, HSL, HSV, CMYK, and packed hexadecimal
# representations. All conversion algorithms are mathematically precise
# implementations of the standard color space transformation formulas.
# Cross-space convenience methods chain through RGB as the intermediate
# representation to avoid redundant algorithm implementations.
